1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,848
Fontainebleau Miami Beach.

2
00:00:01,848 --> 00:00:03,336
Let's count what you get.

3
00:00:04,036 --> 00:00:05,971
Fifteen hundred and four rooms.

4
00:00:05,971 --> 00:00:08,030
The biggest hotel in Miami Beach.

5
00:00:08,680 --> 00:00:11,412
Six hundred fifty eight rooms have a full
kitchen.

6
00:00:12,062 --> 00:00:13,795
Eleven pools, with cabanas.

7
00:00:14,445 --> 00:00:17,186
Twelve restaurants, from Cantonese to
Italian.

8
00:00:17,836 --> 00:00:21,155
Eighteen thousand square feet of night
club, called LIV.

9
00:00:21,155 --> 00:00:22,222
Entry costs extra.

10
00:00:22,872 --> 00:00:26,073
A forty thousand square foot spa, with
sauna and steam.

11
00:00:26,723 --> 00:00:29,677
Eight point six out of ten, rated by real
guests.

12
00:00:30,527 --> 00:00:31,181
The verdict.

13
00:00:31,181 --> 00:00:34,123
Three strengths: the pools, the beach, and
the energy.

14
00:00:34,623 --> 00:00:39,736
Three weak spots: club bass on the low floors, extra fees,
and a long check-in line.

15
00:00:40,236 --> 00:00:40,771
Worth it?

16
00:00:40,771 --> 00:00:43,029
Yes, for party lovers and pool people.

17
00:00:43,029 --> 00:00:44,039
Eight out of ten.
